  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      214.51,
      401.86,
      253.17
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE KUDABUTHGAMUWA SRIPIYADASSINARAMA VIHARASTHANA PERFORMANCE SOCIETY(INCORPORATION)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      265.27,
      401.94,
      342.09
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Society called and known as the\u201cKudabuthgamuwa Sri Piyadassinarama ViharasthanaPerformance Society\u201d has heretofore been formed for thepurpose of effectually carrying out it\u2019s object and transactingall matters concerned with the said Society according to therules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      354.19,
      401.99,
      418.29
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.39,
      401.95,
      456.45
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      468.43,
      401.89,
      507.21
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Kudabuthgamuwa SriPiyadassinarama Viharasthana Performance Society(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      519.31,
      402.07,
      672.33
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cKudabuthgamuwa Sri Piyadassinarama ViharasthanaPerformance Society\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cSociety\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(herein after referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d), with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the\u201cKudabuthgamuwa Sri Piyadassinarama ViharasthanaPerformance Society\u201d and by that name may sue and be suedin all courts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      521.1,
      455.88,
      594.11
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof theKudabuthgamuwaSriPiyadassinaramaViharasthanaPerformanceSociety.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      7.5
    ]
  },
