    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      213.43,
      402.06,
      238.53
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      247.03,
      401.92,
      295.77
    ],
    "text": "(a)acquire, hold, take or give on lease or hire, mortgagepledge, sell, exchange, or otherwise alienate,encumber or dispose of any immovable propertyfor the purpose of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      304.15,
      401.95,
      376.53
    ],
    "text": "(b)enter into and perform or carry out, whether orthrough any officer or agent authorized in thatbehalf by the Corporation, all such contracts oragreements as may be necessary for the attainmentof the objects or the exercise of the powers of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      385.03,
      401.96,
      410.13
    ],
    "text": "(c)accept gifts, donations and bequests in cash or inkind;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      418.51,
      401.91,
      455.49
    ],
    "text": "(d)invest its funds, create and administer Trusts and tomaintain current, deposit and savings accounts inany bank;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      463.99,
      401.92,
